      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article reviews the work on the neonatal effects of low drug doses published in the last five years. At the same time, there will be a focus on new developments in perinatal pharmacology and on current controversies in this area. The article includes discussions about neurobehavioral outcome measures and statistics, as well as recommendations for future studies."},
